// Signing.xcconfig — shared defaults. Don't put your own team here: it's committed, so teammates would
// overwrite each other.
//
// To run Maple on your iPhone:
// 1. Xcode → Settings → Accounts → add your Apple ID.
// 2. Copy Config/Signing.local.example.xcconfig to Config/Signing.local.xcconfig (git ignores it).
// 3. Put your Team ID in it (Xcode shows it next to the team name). Anyone but the owner also sets their own
//    bundle ID and App Group there, because bundle IDs belong to one Apple team.
// 4. Leave MAPLE_TIER = free until your account is in the paid Apple Developer Program.
//    `paid` turns on Family Controls (app blocking) and iCloud, which free teams can't provision.
//
// The Simulator needs none of this.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
MAPLE_TIER = free
